Subject: [PATCH 5/6] check_fun.py: hashfun on a node, with stand-ins and no
 network

The package and its pin, the fun wallet's keys for a launch's node, which
launches are taken on, the limit, one round of the helper, the five
functions and their refusals through Node.call, what the node's loop
offers, the relay under /fun/p2p (bytes both ways, a side that stops
reading, each side ending its sending, an unknown ticker, the caps, a
request naming a host and port) and /fun of the pages. OK in 20 s.

