+    a block of LIVE owes about 14,000 sats of qwen: the node moved 1,000,000 into the fun wallet (FUN_FLOAT; one wallet pays for every launch), and mines one launch with 0.1 of one core
+    two blocks the model asked for: that launch is mined first, with half a core; one block that pays this node leaves one to go, and the order is done with the next
+    while this node fetches its own chain, and when the fun wallet is empty and the limit reached: no launch is mined, and the helper says which
